\title{worldpopulation: Analyze Population Within Circles Around City Centers Worldwide}
\description{
The worldpopulation package provides tools to query population within specified
radii around global city centers using high-resolution Global Human Settlement
Layer (GHS-POP) data from the European Commission Joint Research Centre.

Key features:
\itemize{
  \item Query population within circles around any geographic coordinate
  \item Rank cities worldwide by population at various distances (N km from center)
  \item Compare urban agglomerations across multiple radii
  \item Analyze population distribution patterns and density profiles
  \item Access built-in dataset of 1,000 major world cities
  \item Support for multiple years (1975-2030 including projections)
  \item High-resolution 100m data for accurate population estimates
}
}
